    <summary>Alabaster 0.2beta - (from GridPlayer 0.5.5): play many videos side by side</summary>
    <description>GridPlayer Alabaster is a modified version of GridPlayer by vzhd1701: a VLC-based
media player that plays many videos at the same time in a configurable grid.

Version: Alabaster 0.2beta - (from GridPlayer 0.5.5). This is a pre-release.

VLC (libVLC) is bundled. The app has its own settings folder, so it runs next to
upstream GridPlayer without sharing settings.

## Optional tools (not bundled, install and update them yourself)

- ffmpeg and ffprobe: streams whose sound comes as a separate file (planned merge feature)
- yt-dlp (the program): use a yt-dlp you update yourself instead of the built-in module
- Deno: YouTube's JavaScript challenge, needed for YouTube streaming

Install with Chocolatey: `choco install deno ffmpeg yt-dlp -y`
Update with Chocolatey: `choco upgrade deno ffmpeg yt-dlp -y`

Or with winget: `winget install Gyan.FFmpeg`, `winget install yt-dlp.yt-dlp`, `winget install DenoLand.Deno`

## Notes

- Windows x64 only
- Installs via Inno Setup to Program Files
</description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
